      <activity id="05f5c0ec-0337-5c56-9234-da077668d69d" activityNameId="96506ccc-f149-57c5-a220-8d808f715db1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Surface treatment, wood window, natural/varnished, m2 visible, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Surface treatment, wood window, natural/varnished, m2 visible, at plant
The measures of the window are 1.75m (width) x 1.3m (height). The average visible area is 0.29m2. The bill of materials is based on data from 3 window producers.;
UUID: afec826c-4bda-37bc-8aa8-d9afc63b167c
Included are the materials used for the surface treatment (natural/varnished) for a wooden window. Production losses and transport of the materials are included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 window manufacturers in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_afec826c-4bda-37bc-8aa8-d9afc63b167c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
